@startuml FivePackages_Integration
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title 5-Package Integration (eMach + Pyleecan + SyR-e + PyMotorCAD + PyAEDT)

package "Design Source" {
  component "SyR-e\n(parametric geometry)" as SYRE
  component "Pyleecan\n(OOP machine models)" as PYLEECAN
}

package "Interchange Hub" {
  component "eMach / pyMotorGeo\nDXF parser + classifier + contracts" as EMACH
  component "Geometry/Semantic/Result\nContract v1" as CONTRACT
}

package "CAE Execution" {
  component "PyMotorCAD\n(Motor-CAD RPC automation)" as PYMCAD
  component "PyAEDT\n(Maxwell/TwinBuilder/AEDT automation)" as PYAEDT
}

package "Validation" {
  component "Benchmark 10 cases" as BENCH
  component "Round-trip validator" as VALID
  component "Compatibility report" as REPORT
}

SYRE --> EMACH : DXF export / params
PYLEECAN --> EMACH : geometry import/export
EMACH --> CONTRACT : normalize + annotate
CONTRACT --> PYMCAD : Motor-CAD import payload
CONTRACT --> PYAEDT : AEDT-ready payload
PYMCAD --> PYAEDT : ROM/TwinBuilder link (optional)
PYAEDT --> CONTRACT : solver KPI backfeed
PYMCAD --> CONTRACT : geometry/KPI backfeed

BENCH --> EMACH
BENCH --> PYMCAD
BENCH --> PYAEDT
EMACH --> VALID
PYMCAD --> VALID
PYAEDT --> VALID
VALID --> REPORT

note bottom
Release-blocking path:
SyR-e/Pyleecan -> eMach contract -> PyMotorCAD/PyAEDT import -> round-trip validation

Non-blocking path:
Advanced topology/face refinement (confidence-based fallback)
end note

@enduml
